  "details": "1. Open Vrchat. 2. Loading screen appears for extended amount of time. 3. Screen freezes and vrchat does not load any further. This bug has affected me consistently, and my friend as well. It sometimes loads another frame for a second allowing me to turn around, and after restarting and reinstalling the issue still persists. Video footage of this in action are available at the following links. \n\nhttps://media.discordapp.net/attachments/913827130578726982/1102020900997574706/f72b5b7a6f84f6409b8d40e6187264ea.mp4 (Loading, then freezing)\n\nhttps://media.discordapp.net/attachments/913827130578726982/1102021425340100608/6bd5ae19c7c8beebb98fc81b0a5ec79f.mp4 (Few seconds of \"operation\" in-between freezing.)\n\nVRChat also does not open far enough for me to access the build, but it has been fully updated as of 7:28 Apr 29 2023",
